@startuml Service Register 时序图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxmessagesize 60
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Consul 服务注册时序图

actor "客户端" as Client
participant "HTTP 处理器" as HTTP #LightBlue
participant "Agent" as Agent #LightGreen
participant "本地状态" as LocalState #Yellow
participant "RPC 客户端" as RPC #Orange
participant "Catalog 端点" as Catalog #Pink
participant "FSM" as FSM #LightCyan
participant "状态存储" as StateStore #LightGray
participant "反熵同步" as AntiEntropy #Lavender

== Agent 服务注册流程 ==

Client -> HTTP: PUT /v1/agent/service/register
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/http_register.go:59\nregisterEndpoint()

HTTP -> HTTP: AgentRegisterService()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent_endpoint.go:1150-1165\n解析请求体和企业元数据

HTTP -> HTTP: 验证服务名称
note right: 检查 args.Name != ""

HTTP -> HTTP: 解析 Token 和企业元数据
note right: parseEntMetaNoWildcard()\nparseToken()

HTTP -> Agent: AddService(req)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent.go:2347-2357\nAddServiceRequest 结构

Agent -> Agent: addServiceLocked()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent.go:2361-2389\n获取状态锁

Agent -> Agent: validateService()
note right: 验证服务配置和检查类型

Agent -> Agent: addServiceInternal()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent.go:2534-2557\n内部服务添加逻辑

Agent -> LocalState: AddServiceWithChecks()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/local/state.go\n添加服务到本地状态

LocalState -> LocalState: 更新本地服务状态
note right: 标记服务为未同步状态\nInSync = false

Agent -> AntiEntropy: TriggerSyncChanges()
note right: 触发反熵同步机制

== 反熵同步流程 ==

AntiEntropy -> AntiEntropy: SyncChanges()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/local/state.go:1245-1259\n同步本地状态变更

AntiEntropy -> AntiEntropy: syncNodeInfo()
note right: 同步节点信息

AntiEntropy -> RPC: RPC("Catalog.Register")
note right: 调用 Catalog.Register RPC

== Catalog 注册流程 ==

RPC -> Catalog: Register(args, reply)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/consul/catalog_endpoint.go:107-121

Catalog -> Catalog: ForwardRPC()
note right: 如果不是 Leader，转发到 Leader

Catalog -> Catalog: ResolveTokenAndDefaultMeta()
note right: 解析 ACL Token 和企业元数据

Catalog -> Catalog: validateEnterpriseRequest()
note right: 验证企业版请求

Catalog -> StateStore: ValidateRegisterRequest()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/consul/state/catalog.go\n验证注册请求

Catalog -> Catalog: nodePreApply()
note right: 节点预处理验证

Catalog -> Catalog: servicePreApply()
note right: 服务预处理验证\n检查 ACL 权限

Catalog -> Catalog: checkPreApply()
note right: 健康检查预处理

Catalog -> StateStore: NodeServices()
note right: 查询现有节点服务

Catalog -> Catalog: vetRegisterWithACL()
note right: ACL 权限验证

Catalog -> Catalog: raftApply()
note right: 提交到 Raft 日志

== FSM 状态机处理 ==

Catalog -> FSM: applyRegister()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/consul/fsm/commands_ce.go:153-170\nRaft 日志应用

FSM -> FSM: decodeRegistrationReq()
note right: 解码注册请求

FSM -> StateStore: EnsureRegistration()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/consul/state/catalog.go:143-152\n确保注册事务

StateStore -> StateStore: ensureRegistrationTxn()
note right: 事务性注册处理

StateStore -> StateStore: 更新节点信息
note right: 插入或更新节点记录

StateStore -> StateStore: 更新服务信息
note right: 插入或更新服务记录

StateStore -> StateStore: 更新健康检查
note right: 插入或更新检查记录

StateStore -> StateStore: tx.Commit()
note right: 提交事务

FSM -> Catalog: 返回成功
Catalog -> RPC: 返回成功
RPC -> AntiEntropy: 返回成功

AntiEntropy -> LocalState: 标记服务已同步
note right: InSync = true

LocalState -> Agent: 同步完成
Agent -> HTTP: 返回成功
HTTP -> Client: HTTP 200 OK

== Catalog 直接注册流程 ==

Client -> HTTP: PUT /v1/catalog/register
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/http_register.go:62\nCatalogRegister 端点

HTTP -> HTTP: CatalogRegister()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/catalog_endpoint.go:134-163

HTTP -> HTTP: parseEntMetaNoWildcard()
note right: 解析企业元数据

HTTP -> HTTP: decodeBody()
note right: 解析请求体到 RegisterRequest

HTTP -> HTTP: 设置默认数据中心
note right: args.Datacenter = s.agent.config.Datacenter

HTTP -> HTTP: parseToken()
note right: 解析认证 Token

HTTP -> RPC: RPC("Catalog.Register")
note right: 直接调用 Catalog.Register

note over Catalog, StateStore: 后续流程与上述 Catalog 注册流程相同

RPC -> HTTP: 返回结果
HTTP -> Client: HTTP 200 OK / Error

@enduml
